              "kind": "htmlEditor",
              "richTextValue": "<div style=\"max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 48px 16px;\"><h2 style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 2rem; line-height: 1.2;\">Where last year's grants went</h2><p style=\"margin: 0 0 24px; max-width: 640px;\">Grantees told us how they spent every dollar. Most of it paid the people doing the work. [CONFIRM: the split from last year's grant reports]</p><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Staff 48 percent, Programs 27 percent, Rent and utilities 15 percent, Equipment 10 percent\" style=\"display: flex; height: 32px; max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"flex: 48; background: var(--dxp-g-brand, #2e844a);\"></div><div style=\"flex: 27; background: #032D60;\"></div><div style=\"flex: 15; background: #F4BE45;\"></div><div style=\"flex: 10; background: #EEF1F4;\"></div></div><div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 32px; margin: 16px 0 0;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display: inline-block; width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 3px; background: var(--dxp-g-brand, #2e844a); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(0,0,0,.15);\"></span>Staff <strong>48%</strong></span><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display: inline-block; width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 3px; background: #032D60; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(0,0,0,.15);\"></span>Programs <strong>27%</strong></span><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display: inline-block; width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 3px; background: #F4BE45; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(0,0,0,.15);\"></span>Rent and utilities <strong>15%</strong></span><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display: inline-block; width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 3px; background: #EEF1F4; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(0,0,0,.15);\"></span>Equipment <strong>10%</strong></span></div></div>",
